{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "两个链表从头到尾正好对应整数的个位、十位、百位，因此可以同步遍历并逐位相加。每一步把两个节点值与上一位进位相加，结果节点保存总和对 10 取余的数字，并把整除 10 的部分传给下一位。示例依次得到 7、0、8，返回的逆序链表 [7,0,8] 表示 807。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>两数相加可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  body{ min-height:0; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px clamp(18px, 4vw, 48px) 48px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #fff; font-size:14px; font-weight: 650; }\n  .intro { margin: 0; color: #b9b9b9; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 22px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #3d3d3d; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 16px; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .number-line { margin-bottom: 18px; color: #b9b9b9; }\n  .mono, .digit, .formula, .carry-value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .lists { display: grid; gap: 18px; }\n  .list-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 14px; align-items: start; }\n  .list-name { padding-top: 13px; color: #9cdcfe; font-weight: 600; }\n  .nodes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }\n  .node { width: 76px; min-height:48px; padding: 10px 8px 8px; border: 2px solid #555; border-radius: 9px; background: #1c1c1c; text-align: center; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s; }\n  .digit { display: block; color: #dcdcaa; font-size:14px; line-height: 1.2; }\n  .index { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: #858585; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.25; }\n  .node.active { border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; }\n  .node.active .digit { color: #fff; }\n  .node.active .index { color: #dcecff; }\n  .node.done { border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .node.done .digit { color: #4fc1ff; }\n  .work-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 1.35fr) minmax(210px, .65fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 22px; }\n  .work-card { min-height: 144px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #3d3d3d; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; }\n  .step-badge { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 5px 9px; border-radius: 6px; background: #0e639c; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; }\n  .formula { min-height: 31px; color: #fff; font-size: clamp(17px, 2.8vw, 23px); line-height: 1.45; word-break: break-word; }\n  .explain { min-height: 24px; margin-top: 10px; color: #b9b9b9; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .carry-label { color: #b9b9b9; }\n  .carry-value { margin-top: 10px; color: #3794ff; font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .result-panel { margin-top: 22px; }\n  .result-note { margin-top: 14px; min-height: 25px; color: #b9b9b9; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .result-number { color: #4fc1ff; }\n  .progress { height: 4px; margin-top: 22px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 4px; background: #3a3a3a; }\n  .progress-bar { width: 0; height: 100%; background: #3794ff; transition: width .45s ease; }\n  @media (max-width: 660px) {\n    .work-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .list-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }\n    .list-name { padding-top: 0; }\n    .node { width: 68px; }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}main,.app,.board{max-width:560px!important;margin:0 auto!important;padding:8px 10px 10px!important;display:block!important;min-height:auto!important}h1,.title{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.intro,.lead,.sub,.summary{color:#8d8d8d!important;font-size:12px!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel,.work-card,.step-card,.tree-card{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important;box-shadow:none!important}.panel-title{font-size:13px!important;margin-bottom:6px!important}.progress{height:3px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.nodes .node{width:52px!important;min-height:52px!important;padding:6px 4px!important;border-width:1px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.digit{font-size:14px!important}.index{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.work-grid{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:8px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.step-badge{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:10px!important}.formula{font-size:13px!important;min-height:auto!important}.carry-value{font-size:13px!important;margin-top:4px!important}.list-row{grid-template-columns:40px 1fr!important;gap:6px!important}\n.work-card{min-height:0!important}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>逆序链表上的逐位加法</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">链表头是个位，所以从头结点开始同步相加即可。动画使用示例：<span class=\"mono\">[2,4,3] + [5,6,4]</span>。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">输入链表</div>\n    <div class=\"number-line\">实际表示：<span class=\"mono\">342 + 465</span></div>\n    <div class=\"lists\">\n      <div class=\"list-row\">\n        <div class=\"list-name\">l1</div>\n        <div class=\"nodes\" id=\"list1\">\n          <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">2</span><span class=\"index\">第 0 位 · 个位</span></div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">4</span><span class=\"index\">第 1 位 · 十位</span></div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">3</span><span class=\"index\">第 2 位 · 百位</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"list-row\">\n        <div class=\"list-name\">l2</div>\n        <div class=\"nodes\" id=\"list2\">\n          <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">5</span><span class=\"index\">第 0 位 · 个位</span></div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">6</span><span class=\"index\">第 1 位 · 十位</span></div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">4</span><span class=\"index\">第 2 位 · 百位</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"work-grid\">\n    <div class=\"work-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-badge\" id=\"stepBadge\">准备</div>\n      <div class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\">从两个链表的头结点开始</div>\n      <div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\">初始进位为 0。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"work-card\">\n      <div class=\"carry-label\">传给下一位的进位</div>\n      <div class=\"carry-value\" id=\"carry\">0</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel result-panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">结果链表</div>\n    <div class=\"nodes\" id=\"resultList\">\n      <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">7</span><span class=\"index\">个位</span></div>\n      <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">0</span><span class=\"index\">十位</span></div>\n      <div class=\"node\"><span class=\"digit\">8</span><span class=\"index\">百位</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"result-note\" id=\"resultNote\">等待逐位生成结果节点……</div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progressBar\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    {\n      badge: '准备',\n      formula: '从两个链表的头结点开始',\n      explain: '初始进位为 0。',\n      carry: '0', active: -1, produced: 0, progress: 0\n    },\n    {\n      badge: '第 1 步 · 个位',\n      formula: '2 + 5 + 进位 0 = 7',\n      explain: '结果位取 7，新的进位为 0。',\n      carry: '0', active: 0, produced: 1, progress: 33\n    },\n    {\n      badge: '第 2 步 · 十位',\n      formula: '4 + 6 + 进位 0 = 10',\n      explain: '结果位取 10 % 10 = 0，向下一位进 1。',\n      carry: '1', active: 1, produced: 2, progress: 66\n    },\n    {\n      badge: '第 3 步 · 百位',\n      formula: '3 + 4 + 进位 1 = 8',\n      explain: '结果位取 8，新的进位为 0。',\n      carry: '0', active: 2, produced: 3, progress: 100\n    },\n    {\n      badge: '完成',\n      formula: '[7, 0, 8]',\n      explain: '链表按逆序保存，它表示整数 807。',\n      carry: '0', active: -1, produced: 3, progress: 100\n    }\n  ];\n\n  const input1 = [...document.querySelectorAll('#list1 .node')];\n  const input2 = [...document.querySelectorAll('#list2 .node')];\n  const output = [...document.querySelectorAll('#resultList .node')];\n  const badge = document.getElementById('stepBadge');\n  const formula = document.getElementById('formula');\n  const explain = document.getElementById('explain');\n  const carry = document.getElementById('carry');\n  const resultNote = document.getElementById('resultNote');\n  const progressBar = document.getElementById('progressBar');\n  let cursor = 0;\n\n  function render(step) {\n    badge.textContent = step.badge;\n    formula.textContent = step.formula;\n    explain.textContent = step.explain;\n    carry.textContent = step.carry;\n    progressBar.style.width = step.progress + '%';\n\n    input1.forEach((node, i) => {\n      node.classList.toggle('active', i === step.active);\n      node.classList.toggle('done', i < step.active || (step.badge === '完成'));\n    });\n    input2.forEach((node, i) => {\n      node.classList.toggle('active', i === step.active);\n      node.classList.toggle('done', i < step.active || (step.badge === '完成'));\n    });\n    output.forEach((node, i) => {\n      node.style.visibility = i < step.produced ? 'visible' : 'hidden';\n      node.classList.toggle('active', i === step.produced - 1 && step.badge !== '完成');\n      node.classList.toggle('done', step.badge === '完成' || i < step.produced - 1);\n    });\n\n    if (step.badge === '完成') {\n      resultNote.innerHTML = '得到 <span class=\"result-number mono\">[7,0,8]</span>，即 <span class=\"result-number mono\">807</span>。';\n    } else if (step.produced > 0) {\n      resultNote.textContent = '已生成 ' + step.produced + ' 个结果节点。';\n    } else {\n      resultNote.textContent = '等待逐位生成结果节点……';\n    }\n  }\n\n  render(steps[0]);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    cursor = (cursor + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(steps[cursor]);\n  }, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
